WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:07.549
[opening theme music playing]

01:47.857 --> 01:49.025
[music fades]

01:49.109 --> 01:56.116
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

01:59.786 --> 02:01.788
[woman] Tae-sang, don't trust anyone.

02:01.871 --> 02:02.747
WINTER, 1925

02:02.831 --> 02:05.458
There isn't anyone in this world
who can protect you.

02:05.542 --> 02:07.919
You have to fend for yourself. All right?

02:09.295 --> 02:11.089
[Tae-sang] Mommy, where are you going?

02:13.967 --> 02:14.843
Get in!

02:15.426 --> 02:16.344
Hurry now!

02:17.137 --> 02:19.764
- [somber music playing]
- [breathing heavily] Do not come out.

02:19.848 --> 02:22.225
No matter what happens,
no matter what you hear,

02:22.308 --> 02:23.184
do not come out.

02:23.268 --> 02:26.396
You must stay hidden in this box
till morning and stay silent!

02:26.479 --> 02:27.814
- You hear?
- Mommy, wait…

02:29.190 --> 02:31.234
Stay alive. You've got to.

02:32.402 --> 02:34.362
Promise me you'll stay alive, Tae-Sang.

02:34.863 --> 02:36.322
No matter the cost, huh?

02:37.031 --> 02:37.866
Okay?

02:38.741 --> 02:39.826
[mother sniffles]

02:43.246 --> 02:45.999
- Get in. Get in.
- [vehicle approaches, stops outside]

02:46.082 --> 02:47.125
[mother sniffling]

02:48.877 --> 02:50.170
[footsteps approaching]

02:50.253 --> 02:51.671
[breathes shakily, sniffles]

02:56.593 --> 02:59.429
[officer] You there. Sim Sun-deok.
Where's Kim Si-yeong?

03:00.513 --> 03:04.017
- [Sun-deok] I don't know who that is.
- [officer 2] We know everything!

03:04.517 --> 03:07.770
You're the contact for the rebel,
Kim Si-yeong. Tell us where she is.

03:08.271 --> 03:11.608
[Sun-deok] I have no idea, as to…
what you're talking about.

03:12.150 --> 03:13.818
- [thudding]
- [panicked breathing]

03:14.569 --> 03:15.486
[thudding]

03:15.570 --> 03:17.697
- [blows landing]
- [whimpering]

03:18.740 --> 03:19.824
[yelping]

03:25.455 --> 03:27.040
[breathing heavily]

03:29.125 --> 03:30.501
[muffled thudding]

03:31.628 --> 03:33.922
[Sun-deok] Stay alive. You've got to.

03:34.756 --> 03:36.799
Promise me you'll stay alive, Tae-sang.

03:36.883 --> 03:39.177
[sniffles] No matter the cost, okay?

03:39.260 --> 03:40.720
[Tae-sang sobbing quietly]

03:44.349 --> 03:46.809
So I intend to mean business, too,

03:46.893 --> 03:48.937
if I really want to survive this, ma'am.

03:49.020 --> 03:53.691
I'm sorry, but I don't hope
or daydream about our independence.

03:53.775 --> 03:56.236
There's only one thing
I am concerned about.

03:56.319 --> 03:58.279
I just wanna survive all of this, okay?

03:58.863 --> 04:01.741
So I'll make it as long as I can,
preferably in one piece.

04:06.204 --> 04:10.333
At first, I managed to keep my promise
to my mother pretty well. I survived.

04:10.416 --> 04:11.334
To everyone.

04:11.417 --> 04:12.794
[all] Cheers!

04:12.877 --> 04:16.506
[Tae-sang] But then
my life took an unexpected turn.

04:16.589 --> 04:18.675
Till the cherry blossoms
lose their flowers.

04:21.970 --> 04:23.513
[Tae-sang] It was the moment

04:24.138 --> 04:25.098
when she

04:25.807 --> 04:27.267
came into my life.

04:27.350 --> 04:29.936
Will you make sure
all the prisoners get out safely?

04:31.479 --> 04:33.940
I don't want
any of our own people left behind.

04:34.857 --> 04:38.486
[Tae-sang] I should've thought it over
before promising her so easily.

04:44.158 --> 04:45.743
[Tae-sang breathing heavily]

04:51.958 --> 04:54.168
What this? Where did everyone go?

04:55.545 --> 04:57.046
[distant gunshot echoes]

04:58.339 --> 04:59.632
[ominous music playing]

05:00.800 --> 05:01.926
[shushing]

05:10.893 --> 05:12.353
[all yelping fearfully]

05:15.481 --> 05:17.567
Don't move, or we'll shoot!

05:20.611 --> 05:22.155
Everyone, run! Now! Go!

05:23.031 --> 05:24.407
[panicked screaming]

05:31.247 --> 05:33.124
Hey, Hui-do. Are you okay?

05:33.207 --> 05:34.667
[pained gasping]

05:36.377 --> 05:38.421
All of you, go back to your prison cells,

05:38.504 --> 05:40.757
or I'll put a bullet in everyone's head.

05:40.840 --> 05:41.883
[seething]

05:41.966 --> 05:43.343
You bastard!

05:43.426 --> 05:45.511
Now get going. I told you to go!

05:45.595 --> 05:47.764
Shoot me, then! Go ahead and do it, huh?!

05:47.847 --> 05:49.307
Hui-do, don't! No!

05:50.183 --> 05:53.519
I'll either die here or out there,
so why don't you just do it now?

05:53.603 --> 05:55.605
[wheezing] Just shoot me
and get it over with!

05:55.688 --> 05:56.981
You son of a bitch.

05:57.648 --> 05:59.859
Just shoot me now.
Just go ahead and do it!

05:59.942 --> 06:02.028
- [gunshot]
- [prisoners screaming]

06:03.696 --> 06:04.530
[gunshot]

06:04.614 --> 06:06.240
[gunshots]

06:11.954 --> 06:13.373
[suspenseful music playing]

06:21.297 --> 06:22.924
[dramatic music playing]

06:25.218 --> 06:26.928
[breathing heavily] Huh?

06:28.971 --> 06:32.392
Hey, let's go! Everyone, come with me.
There's a room behind the steel door.

06:32.475 --> 06:33.935
We can hide there for the time being.

06:34.852 --> 06:36.562
Let's go! Come on!

06:36.646 --> 06:37.814
[confused murmuring]

06:37.897 --> 06:39.065
[shocked gasping]

06:44.070 --> 06:45.905
Hurry! Come on! Come on!

06:47.407 --> 06:48.408
Move, hurry!

06:52.412 --> 06:53.329
Stop right there!

06:53.413 --> 06:54.288
[Tae-sang gasps]

06:54.914 --> 06:56.374
[breathing heavily]

07:03.548 --> 07:05.425
[creature snarling]

07:08.219 --> 07:10.054
[ominous music playing]

07:13.641 --> 07:15.017
[creature growls]

07:21.357 --> 07:23.192
- [body thuds]
- [prisoners whimpering]

07:23.276 --> 07:26.154
- [creature growls]
- [Kato] It all began with this right here.

07:32.285 --> 07:36.038
Once the Najin… enters the human body,

07:37.915 --> 07:39.500
it takes over the brain.

07:40.084 --> 07:42.962
After it gains complete control
of the brain's synapses…

07:45.923 --> 07:47.508
everything begins to mutate.

07:47.592 --> 07:50.303
I asked you where my mother is,
not a science lecture.

07:51.012 --> 07:52.138
Tell me where she is!

07:52.722 --> 07:53.556
I'll shoot.

07:53.639 --> 07:56.100
Ultimately, all life forms seek to evolve.

07:56.601 --> 07:59.228
Like natural selection,
only the strongest survive.

07:59.896 --> 08:01.314
Humans, in particular,

08:02.106 --> 08:05.443
desire to become the apex predator,
and hopes to be the strongest of them.

08:09.030 --> 08:12.074
Now, because of this tiny organism
that I have right here,

08:12.158 --> 08:14.368
all that I have dreamed of is possible.

08:17.580 --> 08:18.581
[creature growling]

08:18.664 --> 08:19.624
Run.

08:19.707 --> 08:21.000
[breathing shakily]

08:22.001 --> 08:23.252
Run!

08:23.336 --> 08:25.671
- [prisoners screaming]
- [creature roaring]

08:25.755 --> 08:27.256
[dramatic music playing]

08:30.218 --> 08:31.594
[panicked yelping]

08:33.012 --> 08:34.263
[prisoners screaming]

08:39.143 --> 08:40.102
[tentacle stabs]

08:40.186 --> 08:41.270
[yelling]

08:41.354 --> 08:44.607
[Kato] For the time being,
the creature won't stop hunting.

08:50.530 --> 08:51.572
Hui-do!

08:52.532 --> 08:53.533
[Hui-do spluttering]

08:53.616 --> 08:58.454
[Kato] The instinct to kill mercilessly
is its singular motive for survival.

09:02.542 --> 09:04.126
- [gasping]
- [rifle cocks]

09:06.796 --> 09:07.797
[screaming]

09:09.257 --> 09:10.258
No, don't!

09:10.341 --> 09:11.759
- I said don't!
- [wailing[

09:12.343 --> 09:14.720
Aah! Hui-do! Hui-do!

09:14.804 --> 09:16.305
[panting]

09:19.559 --> 09:21.060
[creature growling]

09:25.147 --> 09:26.649
[snarling]

09:27.441 --> 09:29.110
[terrified yelping]

09:31.779 --> 09:33.114
[whimpering]

09:39.078 --> 09:41.372
[roaring]

09:43.374 --> 09:45.001
- [gunshot]
- [growling]

09:47.128 --> 09:49.213
[gunshots]

09:49.297 --> 09:50.840
[screeching]

10:03.019 --> 10:04.395
[breathing heavily]

10:04.478 --> 10:05.354
[creature snarls]

10:16.657 --> 10:18.034
[snarling]

10:20.036 --> 10:21.746
[roaring angrily]

10:22.538 --> 10:24.457
[panicked breathing] Help me.

10:26.917 --> 10:28.294
[pained groaning]

10:28.377 --> 10:29.879
[ferocious growling]

10:33.007 --> 10:33.841
Ah shit.

10:39.013 --> 10:40.139
[empty clip clicking]

10:41.557 --> 10:43.100
[growling menacingly]

10:43.893 --> 10:45.770
[breathing heavily]

10:49.857 --> 10:50.983
Damn it! Come on!

10:51.067 --> 10:52.526
[suspenseful music playing]

10:53.861 --> 10:55.321
[panicked gasping]

11:04.163 --> 11:06.082
[growling]

11:13.547 --> 11:15.216
[roaring]

11:22.014 --> 11:23.307
[music fades]

11:33.025 --> 11:34.151
[Tae-sang coughing]

11:38.823 --> 11:40.366
[gasps wheezily, coughing]

11:44.704 --> 11:45.663
[yelps]

11:50.543 --> 11:51.711
[In-hyeok coughing]

11:51.794 --> 11:53.045
[footsteps approaching]

11:55.256 --> 11:56.716
Please, save me.

12:01.512 --> 12:03.139
- Let's go.
- [gasps]

12:03.931 --> 12:05.349
[In-hyeok coughing]

12:09.103 --> 12:10.688
[suspenseful music playing]

12:10.771 --> 12:13.107
[gas hissing]

12:17.111 --> 12:18.863
[ominous music playing]

12:24.910 --> 12:26.203
[Kato] The human race

12:27.121 --> 12:28.831
will soon meet a new world.

12:29.999 --> 12:31.709
And your beautiful mother

12:33.419 --> 12:35.379
is the one who ushered in that world.

12:37.339 --> 12:38.758
Your mother helped us do that.

12:47.600 --> 12:49.143
[tense music playing]

12:49.226 --> 12:51.061
[breathing softly]

13:05.242 --> 13:08.579
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN MONSTER AND HUMAN

13:08.662 --> 13:11.248
EPISODE 6 CHAOS

13:11.832 --> 13:13.334
WOMEN DISAPPEARING IN GYEONGSEONG

13:13.417 --> 13:17.046
Interesting tip-off.
So what, uh, I'm hearing is,

13:17.129 --> 13:19.465
the hospital
and the missing women cases are linked,

13:19.548 --> 13:21.675
and you'd like it if I'd investigate.

13:22.885 --> 13:23.719
Correct?

13:24.470 --> 13:26.555
Yes, there are crimes happening there.

13:27.181 --> 13:29.308
Commissioner Ishikawa,
you must investigate.

13:29.809 --> 13:32.353
At the very least, take a look
to give you peace of mind.

13:33.813 --> 13:36.023
Well, you see, it's not my jurisdiction.

13:36.106 --> 13:39.735
As head of the police bureau,
I can't just march in there. [chuckles]

13:39.819 --> 13:41.487
You know that as well as I do.

13:44.281 --> 13:47.535
I heard that Master Jang
found Myeong-ja in the hospital.

13:49.119 --> 13:51.664
Unfortunately,
my son was dragged into this,

13:51.747 --> 13:53.290
and they are both in trouble now.

13:59.171 --> 14:00.422
So your son is there.

14:01.549 --> 14:02.758
What are you trying to propose?

14:02.842 --> 14:04.176
I just want

14:05.177 --> 14:07.304
to get my son back safely, Commissioner.

14:07.972 --> 14:09.181
That's all I want from you.

14:18.899 --> 14:20.150
[sighs]

14:25.573 --> 14:26.782
[car door closes]

14:36.625 --> 14:39.712
[Mr. Gu] But do you think
that we can really trust him?

14:40.462 --> 14:44.216
Have you seen me trust anyone, Mr. Gu?
Please be realistic, hmm?

14:45.301 --> 14:47.595
I don't even trust myself, to be honest.

14:48.429 --> 14:51.348
Well, surely you trust
everybody you work with, right? Huh?

14:51.432 --> 14:53.767
Considering everything we've been through?

14:53.851 --> 14:56.353
We're like family.
You and I always stick together.

14:56.437 --> 14:57.771
Has anybody ever

14:58.939 --> 15:00.733
ripped out your fingernails
from your hands?

15:02.526 --> 15:04.361
Has anyone ever burned your skin?

15:05.112 --> 15:07.114
Have you ever been electrocuted before?

15:07.907 --> 15:09.533
No, I haven't been electrocuted.

15:09.617 --> 15:11.911
That doesn't sound very appealing.
Why do you ask?

15:12.494 --> 15:15.039
Do you know what happens to a person when

15:16.165 --> 15:19.335
someone forces chili powder
and water up the person's nose

15:19.835 --> 15:21.170
while they hang upside down?

15:21.253 --> 15:23.589
Well, I don't really want
to imagine that, okay?

15:24.256 --> 15:25.674
You get to that point,

15:27.176 --> 15:29.762
you can no longer remember
you're a human being.

15:31.180 --> 15:33.265
If they tell you to jump, you do it.

15:34.433 --> 15:36.477
You will do whatever they tell you to.

15:37.937 --> 15:40.230
When you're being tortured,
nothing matters.

15:41.482 --> 15:42.524
Not your friends.

15:43.192 --> 15:44.902
Not even family members.

15:46.695 --> 15:48.280
What's is up with you, huh?

15:48.364 --> 15:49.657
You're scaring me.

15:50.366 --> 15:52.785
Why are you talking about
such disturbing things?

15:56.872 --> 15:59.249
If you're ever in
a situation like that, Mr. Gu,

15:59.917 --> 16:00.793
don't be a hero.

16:00.876 --> 16:04.505
It's just going to make it worse for you.
Instead, tell them everything.

16:05.172 --> 16:07.758
If you ever end up in that situation,
just know that

16:07.841 --> 16:09.802
if you betray us, I won't resent you.

16:10.970 --> 16:11.887
Keep that in mind.

16:12.846 --> 16:13.681
[Mr. Gu sighs]

16:16.100 --> 16:18.811
We're late. We better head back.

16:19.395 --> 16:21.105
I would never betray anyone, okay?

16:22.106 --> 16:24.233
Even if I did find myself
in a situation like that,

16:25.859 --> 16:28.028
I wouldn't betray any of you.
Is that clear?

16:28.696 --> 16:31.699
So how about you keep that in mind,
would you? [huffs]

16:32.449 --> 16:33.283
My goodness!

16:48.382 --> 16:49.758
[solemn music playing]

16:57.224 --> 16:58.809
[Mrs. Nawol gasping weakly]

17:02.104 --> 17:03.731
[groans, gasping]

17:35.763 --> 17:36.972
[moaning]

17:44.021 --> 17:45.314
[groaning weakly]

17:52.571 --> 17:53.530
[groans]

17:54.406 --> 17:55.908
[breathing shakily]

17:57.493 --> 17:58.994
[relieved moaning]

18:02.706 --> 18:05.959
Are you okay?
How long were you in there for? Huh?

18:06.043 --> 18:07.586
[relieved moaning]

18:09.546 --> 18:12.633
Where is my mommy?
Did you see her inside of there?

18:13.759 --> 18:15.302
Did you see my mommy in there?

18:17.012 --> 18:19.973
Her name is Shim Sun-Deok.
Did you see her?

18:24.186 --> 18:25.354
Do you know her at all?

18:33.070 --> 18:34.071
I don't know her.

18:35.030 --> 18:37.032
Her name doesn't remind you of anyone?

18:38.909 --> 18:40.410
It doesn't. I'm so sorry.

18:48.877 --> 18:50.295
It's cold out here.

18:52.131 --> 18:53.173
Here, drink this.

18:54.174 --> 18:55.843
You should go home soon, okay?

19:09.815 --> 19:12.192
[Mrs. Nawol sobbing gently]

19:34.965 --> 19:36.175
[moaning weakly]

19:51.773 --> 19:53.275
[music fades]

20:01.491 --> 20:03.160
Why didn't you wait like I asked you to?

20:04.786 --> 20:08.207
I gave you the key and said to wait
until I came back. You said you would!

20:10.125 --> 20:12.002
[Hui-do] He's not coming back for us.

20:12.085 --> 20:15.464
We all know that Master Jang is
nothing more than a selfish prick.

20:15.547 --> 20:17.758
That bastard's only concerned
with how much money he makes

20:17.841 --> 20:19.259
and how to get more of it!

20:19.885 --> 20:20.969
He said I'm a selfish prick?

20:21.053 --> 20:23.555
Well, you've always
only cared about yourself.

20:23.639 --> 20:25.140
You've never helped us,

20:25.724 --> 20:28.769
even when our country fell to ruin
and our people suffered greatly.

20:28.852 --> 20:32.981
Comrade Kwon has tried to get you to join
our rebellion, but you always refused him.

20:33.482 --> 20:34.316
Right?

20:35.984 --> 20:37.653
Let me ask you something, hmm?

20:38.612 --> 20:41.698
Do you think anyone who doesn't join
your rebellion is a very bad person?

20:41.782 --> 20:44.826
Anyone who doesn't vocalize their loyalty
can't be trusted.

20:45.827 --> 20:47.162
You're not trustworthy.

20:47.246 --> 20:50.415
So I'm not trustworthy
'cause I don't do things the way you do?

20:50.499 --> 20:53.335
- Hui-do's dead because of you.
- I was trying to save him!

20:54.253 --> 20:55.754
All I wanted was to get everyone out--

20:55.837 --> 20:58.006
Then you should have waited like I asked!

20:58.090 --> 21:00.509
You don't even know
how to get us out of this place!

21:00.592 --> 21:03.345
After you freed everyone,
how were you planning to get out of here?

21:03.428 --> 21:06.473
You ran straight into the Japanese army,
and now many of our own are dead!

21:06.556 --> 21:08.225
It was an inevitable sacrifice.

21:08.308 --> 21:11.186
How was it inevitable?
It could've been prevented!

21:11.728 --> 21:13.647
I gave the key to you, nobody else.

21:13.730 --> 21:15.857
If it wasn't for you,
many of them would still be alive!

21:15.941 --> 21:17.442
You better let me go right--

21:17.526 --> 21:20.904
Stop justifying your actions
and understand that you messed up here!

21:20.988 --> 21:23.573
That this was all your fault!
This wasn't the plan!

21:24.533 --> 21:26.910
What you did back there
was stupid and reckless.

21:26.994 --> 21:30.122
You're nothing but a coward who cared
about his own damn life. Got that?!

21:30.205 --> 21:31.707
[In-hyeok breathing shakily]

21:37.337 --> 21:39.339
He told me you had real conviction.

21:41.466 --> 21:43.468
I guess Jun-taek was wrong
about what you're made of.

21:51.852 --> 21:53.145
[In-hyeok sobbing]

21:56.898 --> 21:57.816
[exhales sharply]

21:58.859 --> 22:00.277
[tense music playing]

22:17.627 --> 22:21.131
Now how about you list all the members
in the Joseon Patriotic Society?

22:21.214 --> 22:22.257
Write all the names.

22:28.096 --> 22:29.723
Write down everyone you know of.

22:36.271 --> 22:37.731
[footsteps approaching]

22:41.651 --> 22:43.111
Master Jang, it's me.

22:43.195 --> 22:44.738
[breathing heavily]

22:46.948 --> 22:48.867
- I'm relieved to see you.
- [drops pipe]

22:56.124 --> 22:57.626
Did anything happen to you?

22:58.418 --> 22:59.336
You're injured!

23:00.212 --> 23:01.380
I'm fine, really.

23:03.799 --> 23:05.050
Where is my daughter?

23:07.386 --> 23:08.637
Where's Chae-ok?

23:16.728 --> 23:18.063
That thing isn't my mother.

23:18.146 --> 23:19.564
[unsettling music playing]

23:20.065 --> 23:21.483
Tell me it isn't true.

23:22.234 --> 23:24.945
You're lying.
There's no way that's even possible, huh?

23:25.570 --> 23:27.781
How can a human being
turn into a creature like that?

23:27.864 --> 23:29.991
- I know you're lying.
- Not just a creature!

23:30.075 --> 23:31.451
She's advancing science!

23:32.077 --> 23:34.538
My creation has become
more powerful and stronger

23:34.621 --> 23:37.958
than anything anyone has ever created!
Don't you agree?

23:39.960 --> 23:41.878
Would you like to experience it yourself?

23:44.381 --> 23:45.215
What?

23:45.298 --> 23:46.550
Join your mother.

23:48.343 --> 23:50.720
If you mutate just like she did,
then maybe

23:51.805 --> 23:53.432
she might finally recognize you.

23:53.515 --> 23:54.558
You'll be reunited.

23:55.308 --> 23:56.393
Damn you!

23:56.476 --> 23:58.520
You crazy bastard! [breathing heavily]

23:58.603 --> 23:59.479
[Kato gasps]

23:59.563 --> 24:02.274
You bastard. How could you do this?!

24:05.861 --> 24:07.195
[Kato breathes heavily]

24:07.779 --> 24:09.281
How do you stop the monster?

24:10.490 --> 24:12.617
How do you stop her from killing everyone?

24:12.701 --> 24:14.911
You won't be able to stop her.

24:16.288 --> 24:17.122
Because I…

24:20.083 --> 24:21.626
I don't wanna stop her.

24:21.710 --> 24:22.627
[chuckles cruelly]

24:22.711 --> 24:25.422
- [breathing emotionally]
- [Kato chuckling]

24:29.801 --> 24:30.927
So you're telling me…

24:33.096 --> 24:35.724
[sighs] …that my wife
was imprisoned inside here?

24:36.224 --> 24:38.727
Your wife had left a message on the wall.

24:38.810 --> 24:40.979
What happened to her afterwards
is unclear.

24:41.062 --> 24:42.856
We don't know
whether she might be in here.

24:42.939 --> 24:45.609
So that's where Chae-ok went, then?
To find her?

24:49.654 --> 24:53.116
Yes, she went to get more answers.
I'm sorry, I should've stayed.

24:54.743 --> 24:55.911
Don't apologize.

24:57.579 --> 25:00.415
I know my daughter, and I know
you're just doing your part in all this.

25:01.750 --> 25:03.210
I knew you were a good man.

25:03.710 --> 25:06.129
You may act all tough
and hard on the outside,

25:06.671 --> 25:09.508
but deep down I always knew
you'd do the right thing for our people.

25:11.343 --> 25:12.302
[Tae-sang sighs]

25:13.303 --> 25:15.847
[Jung-won] Thanks to you,
everyone here gets to live.

25:20.769 --> 25:21.603
[clears throat]

25:25.357 --> 25:27.108
We still need to get these people out.

25:27.192 --> 25:30.070
In the meantime,
we need to move them somewhere safe.

25:30.153 --> 25:32.697
I need your help with finding a place
for everyone to hide. Please.

25:44.000 --> 25:46.628
If you take everyone up these stairs
onto the second floor,

25:46.711 --> 25:48.338
it should lead
to a deserted hospital ward.

25:48.421 --> 25:49.965
Find the best place to hide.

25:50.048 --> 25:52.217
The Japanese army vacated
that part of the building

25:52.300 --> 25:53.552
due to a tuberculosis outbreak.

25:53.635 --> 25:56.346
You shouldn't have much trouble
getting inside there.

25:56.846 --> 25:59.015
You'll be safe in that ward,
I'm sure of it.

25:59.599 --> 26:00.934
What makes you sure of it?

26:01.017 --> 26:03.562
I paid a very high price
for that information.

26:03.645 --> 26:06.481
- You have my word it's safe.
- What are you going to do?

26:11.111 --> 26:14.364
I'm going to find your daughter.
When I do, I'll bring her to you.

26:16.866 --> 26:17.951
[Jung-won sighs]

26:20.662 --> 26:22.080
Be safe out there, you hear?

26:28.128 --> 26:29.129
All right, everyone,

26:29.212 --> 26:31.798
I know you must be very tired,
but we can't stay.

26:31.881 --> 26:34.467
I'm going to move us to a safer location
for the time being.

26:35.885 --> 26:37.429
[suspenseful music playing]

26:39.431 --> 26:40.432
This way.

26:48.148 --> 26:48.982
Wait a moment.

26:52.819 --> 26:54.571
Master Jang asked me to give you this.

26:58.783 --> 27:00.577
I trust you to cover the rear.

27:08.877 --> 27:09.711
[grunts]

27:15.925 --> 27:17.093
[music fades]

27:17.177 --> 27:18.803
[rapid footsteps approaching]

27:21.389 --> 27:22.724
[sighs]

27:28.605 --> 27:30.607
Director, you asked for me?

27:30.690 --> 27:32.734
You son of a bitch!

27:32.817 --> 27:34.194
- You idiot!
- [whimpers]

27:34.277 --> 27:35.487
[Ichiro] Stupid bastard!

27:36.112 --> 27:38.323
Why the hell are all these doors open?!

27:38.406 --> 27:40.200
Why are all these cells empty?

27:40.283 --> 27:41.534
- Why?!
- [panting]

27:41.618 --> 27:43.703
[Ichiro] Where… are they?

27:43.787 --> 27:44.954
[whimpering]

27:45.830 --> 27:48.541
Please give me time.
I'll find out what happened and--

27:48.625 --> 27:50.001
How could you not know?

27:50.835 --> 27:53.296
You're the one in charge here,
you stupid idiot!

27:54.130 --> 27:54.964
- Fool!
- [groans]

27:55.465 --> 27:58.051
I should… kill… you!

27:58.134 --> 27:59.552
I'm sorry, sir! Sorry! Argh!

27:59.636 --> 28:01.429
Sorry, sir! Argh! Forgive me, sir!

28:01.513 --> 28:03.473
[soldier] Director, we have a big problem.

28:03.973 --> 28:05.892
[Ichiro breathing heavily]

28:07.185 --> 28:08.645
[ominous music playing]

28:12.023 --> 28:13.024
[Kato] What is it?

28:17.779 --> 28:19.989
We've discovered corpses
infected by anthrax

28:20.073 --> 28:21.449
on basement levels one and two.

28:22.575 --> 28:23.702
Where is the creature?

28:26.496 --> 28:28.373
[ominous music continues]

28:33.211 --> 28:35.463
[heartbeat rhythm echoing]

28:39.217 --> 28:40.218
Know its whereabouts?

28:40.301 --> 28:43.722
We were unable to locate the creature.
It wasn't in the area when we got there.

28:49.561 --> 28:50.937
What else did you see?

28:54.232 --> 28:56.234
A platoon just discovered 13 corpses.

28:56.317 --> 28:59.946
They were covered in anthrax spores.
The other bodies had gunshot wounds.

29:00.029 --> 29:02.615
Nine of the bodies we found
were Joseon prisoners that escaped.

29:02.699 --> 29:04.033
Where are the rest?

29:05.118 --> 29:06.786
I don't care about the dead!

29:07.370 --> 29:09.456
Where are the Josenjings
who are still alive?

29:09.539 --> 29:11.499
Oh, my apologies, Director.

29:11.583 --> 29:13.710
We haven't found
the rest of the prisoners.

29:18.089 --> 29:20.800
Sir, I have a message for you
from the guard station.

29:20.884 --> 29:22.218
What the hell do you want now?

29:22.302 --> 29:24.387
Commissioner Ishikawa has arrived, sir.

29:24.471 --> 29:27.849
He requests your cooperation with
the investigation into the disappearances.

29:27.932 --> 29:29.184
Ishikawa?

29:31.352 --> 29:32.270
Did you hear that?

29:32.353 --> 29:35.440
Things are so bad, even the commissioner
knows something's wrong here!

29:36.107 --> 29:37.734
Please forgive me, Director Ichiro!

29:37.817 --> 29:39.486
[groaning]

29:40.862 --> 29:42.572
You better find them, Mr. Soma!

29:42.655 --> 29:43.740
Yes, Director!

29:43.823 --> 29:45.033
[panting]

29:47.952 --> 29:48.787
[gasps]

29:49.412 --> 29:52.582
If a single prisoner
escapes from this hospital,

29:52.665 --> 29:56.085
you and your family will be imprisoned
in their place. You got that?

29:57.462 --> 29:58.880
And I won't stop there.

29:59.506 --> 30:01.966
I will remove their intestines
while they're still alive,

30:02.050 --> 30:03.760
and you can watch the whole thing!

30:04.260 --> 30:05.094
Understand?

30:07.388 --> 30:10.183
Do you understand what I'm saying,
you stupid idiot?

30:10.266 --> 30:11.559
[whimpers] Uh-huh!

30:13.978 --> 30:14.813
[Ichiro] Moron!

30:22.779 --> 30:24.155
[breathing shakily]

30:31.579 --> 30:32.580
Walk faster.

30:33.748 --> 30:36.125
You and I are gonna
find that creature together.

30:36.709 --> 30:39.796
And if we find her…
what do you think will happen next?

30:39.879 --> 30:42.382
We'll find a way
to stop it from killing everyone.

30:42.465 --> 30:43.800
I have no idea how to do that.

30:44.551 --> 30:47.387
Then think of a way to.
You created it, after all.

30:47.470 --> 30:48.847
[man] Lt. Kato.

30:53.768 --> 30:54.686
What is it?

30:54.769 --> 30:57.146
We are tracking the creature
on the level below.

30:57.230 --> 30:58.982
It's time we used the nitrogen.

30:59.065 --> 31:02.944
We need all the gas to fumigate level two
in order to coax the creature out.

31:03.444 --> 31:06.030
And what if that fails
and you can't capture it?

31:06.114 --> 31:07.282
Do you have another plan?

31:07.866 --> 31:10.785
That's why I'm here.
Give the order, and I'll oversee it.

31:11.327 --> 31:14.038
We must do everything we can
to prevent it from escaping the building.

31:15.874 --> 31:17.542
[tense music playing]

31:20.461 --> 31:21.546
You wanna shoot her dead?

31:22.130 --> 31:25.133
[soldier] Sir, we cannot afford
to lose any more men.

31:25.216 --> 31:28.970
Just give us your permission,
and I will… kill the creature, sir.

31:29.053 --> 31:30.513
[sighs smugly]

31:31.806 --> 31:34.183
Actually, I do know a way to kill Seishin.

31:35.184 --> 31:38.187
- Would you like to know how?
- [soldier] What is it, sir?

31:38.938 --> 31:40.189
Burn it alive.

31:40.899 --> 31:42.442
[pained screeching]

31:43.234 --> 31:44.861
But do you believe

31:46.237 --> 31:47.196
you can do that?

31:48.197 --> 31:49.032
Sir?

31:49.866 --> 31:52.201
She is your mother, as you already know.

31:53.870 --> 31:55.455
Think you can kill your own mother?

31:55.538 --> 31:56.539
[breathing shakily]

31:57.040 --> 31:58.207
Shit, it's her!

32:00.585 --> 32:02.170
Although her appearance has changed,

32:02.253 --> 32:04.297
somewhere deep down
she's still your mother.

32:04.380 --> 32:06.716
So do you really think you can kill her?

32:06.799 --> 32:07.800
Huh?!

32:10.470 --> 32:11.554
[music fades]

32:13.765 --> 32:16.142
[pleasant classical music playing gently]

32:32.784 --> 32:35.036
You have a message from Mr. Shiro, ma'am.

32:47.048 --> 32:48.925
[phone ringing]

32:53.888 --> 32:55.431
[phone continues ringing]

32:56.683 --> 32:57.809
[outgoing call tone]

33:01.062 --> 33:02.146
[replaces receiver]

33:04.190 --> 33:08.736
THE MISSION TO RESCUE AKIKO HAS BEGUN

33:08.820 --> 33:09.862
[chimes clinking]

33:12.991 --> 33:14.450
[somber music playing]

33:18.621 --> 33:21.165
- [door bell chiming]
- [intriguing music playing]

33:36.556 --> 33:37.974
[music intensifies]

34:16.262 --> 34:18.056
- [footsteps approaching]
- [gasps]

34:18.681 --> 34:19.807
[key turning in lock]

34:50.463 --> 34:52.173
It's been a long time, Director.

34:53.216 --> 34:54.842
What brings you here, Commissioner?

34:55.927 --> 34:59.263
I got a tip recently connecting
this hospital to the missing women.

34:59.347 --> 35:02.475
I'm sure you've heard
the hospital is closed indefinitely.

35:02.558 --> 35:05.812
So, unfortunately,
outsiders are not permitted to enter.

35:05.895 --> 35:07.438
The hospital is closed because…?

35:07.522 --> 35:10.608
There was an outbreak
of an unknown infectious disease.

35:10.691 --> 35:13.903
It's extremely contagious,
so I hope you understand.

35:13.986 --> 35:15.738
If the disease is so contagious,

35:15.822 --> 35:18.533
why isn't anyone taking
any precautionary measures

35:18.616 --> 35:20.076
or wearing protective clothing?

35:20.159 --> 35:23.371
So it appears we should be fine
setting foot into your hospital.

35:25.832 --> 35:27.917
This is under military jurisdiction.

35:28.876 --> 35:32.255
The police have no authority
with what happens inside this hospital.

35:32.338 --> 35:34.090
I've got missing civilians.

35:34.173 --> 35:36.592
Despite the jurisdiction limitations,
I have to investigate.

35:40.513 --> 35:43.224
Don't let me look weak
in front of my subordinates.

35:43.891 --> 35:47.436
Why don't you just let me investigate,
even if it's pretend for the time being?

35:55.153 --> 35:57.321
Thank you very much. I'll be quick.

36:06.038 --> 36:08.624
- Move the girl where she cannot be found.
- Yes, sir.

36:12.211 --> 36:13.880
[ominous music playing]

36:42.241 --> 36:43.701
- [gun cocks]
- [man] Put your hands up.

36:45.161 --> 36:47.747
Who are you?
How did you get inside of here?

36:50.541 --> 36:52.710
I'm just looking for someone, that's all.

36:54.921 --> 36:56.130
Where did the woman go?

36:57.381 --> 36:59.383
What did you do
with the woman that was here?

37:08.893 --> 37:10.102
[music fades]

37:28.663 --> 37:29.580
[gasps]

37:41.008 --> 37:42.468
[panting]

37:49.976 --> 37:51.602
[heavy breathing in distance]

37:58.651 --> 38:00.236
[tense music playing]

38:07.034 --> 38:09.328
[music intensifies]

38:14.959 --> 38:16.085
Get in the cell.

38:16.752 --> 38:17.753
Right this second!

38:22.508 --> 38:25.344
Sorry to disappoint,
but I'm very busy. I can't stay.

38:25.428 --> 38:26.345
I said get inside!

38:28.347 --> 38:29.640
Didn't I just tell you?

38:30.182 --> 38:33.644
I'm very busy and I can't stay,
so how about you stop wasting my time?

38:43.821 --> 38:45.156
[locking door]

38:49.035 --> 38:50.119
[sighs]

38:50.202 --> 38:51.078
[ominous beat]

38:54.832 --> 38:55.708
[ominous beat]

38:57.418 --> 38:59.378
[suspenseful music playing]

39:02.882 --> 39:03.883
[Chae-ok grunting]

39:04.759 --> 39:05.593
[groans angrily]

39:09.305 --> 39:11.015
- [straining]
- [Kato] It's no use.

39:13.559 --> 39:14.810
Don't waste your energy.

39:15.311 --> 39:17.313
What the hell are you doing?

39:19.440 --> 39:20.566
[Kato] Very soon,

39:21.233 --> 39:24.362
your precious mother will show herself,
and you will be reunited.

39:29.408 --> 39:31.952
You said you haven't seen her
in over ten years.

39:32.036 --> 39:35.790
To be honest, I'm not sure
if your mother will even recognize you.

39:38.918 --> 39:40.002
Where's the creature?

39:40.753 --> 39:43.547
The creature is trapped
inside of the elevator, sir.

39:59.397 --> 40:00.648
[creature snarling]

40:03.401 --> 40:04.652
[creature screeching]

40:15.204 --> 40:16.956
[gas hissing]

40:20.459 --> 40:21.961
[elevator clunking]

40:22.795 --> 40:24.338
[suspenseful music continues]

40:49.864 --> 40:51.282
[man coughing]

40:52.867 --> 40:53.993
[groaning]

41:04.420 --> 41:05.254
- Hey.
- [grunts]

41:05.754 --> 41:07.131
- [Tae-sang] Hey!
- [grunting]

41:14.472 --> 41:15.473
That woman, she…

41:16.098 --> 41:17.892
she took off my uniform
and then she ran out.

41:17.975 --> 41:20.769
She took all my clothes,
and then Soma beat me.

41:20.853 --> 41:22.021
[muffled grunting]

41:22.855 --> 41:25.316
I wanna know,
where did the woman run off to?

41:25.399 --> 41:26.400
[muffled groaning]

41:26.484 --> 41:28.444
[creature roaring in distance]

41:33.699 --> 41:35.034
[elevator rumbling]

41:40.581 --> 41:42.208
[tense music playing]

41:44.126 --> 41:45.127
[thudding]

41:54.428 --> 41:56.138
[creature growling softly]

42:36.470 --> 42:39.348
Lt. Kato,
what will happen to the woman down there?

42:40.599 --> 42:43.519
Will she die?
Is the plan for the creature to kill her?

42:43.602 --> 42:44.853
Damn it, Josenjing.

42:45.646 --> 42:47.398
This is not the place or time to speak.

42:48.649 --> 42:49.984
[man] I'm sorry, sir.

42:52.987 --> 42:54.530
[breathing heavily]

42:59.159 --> 43:00.661
[heavy footsteps thudding]

43:01.620 --> 43:03.122
[creature growling]

43:08.752 --> 43:10.588
[creature snarling]

43:18.721 --> 43:20.889
[creature roaring]

43:22.975 --> 43:24.310
[limbs slithering wetly]

43:25.519 --> 43:26.395
[Chae-ok gasps]

43:26.478 --> 43:28.022
[heavy footsteps approaching]

43:28.105 --> 43:29.440
[creature growling]

43:31.066 --> 43:32.568
[suspenseful music building]

43:36.488 --> 43:38.657
[creature growling]

43:51.545 --> 43:53.213
[creature growling softly]

43:58.427 --> 43:59.595
[breathing shakily]

44:00.512 --> 44:02.806
[creature growling]

44:04.475 --> 44:06.018
[creature snarling]

44:10.022 --> 44:11.023
Do it, Seishin.

44:12.066 --> 44:13.651
[creature roaring]

44:15.944 --> 44:18.113
Go ahead and kill her, my Seishin.

44:19.531 --> 44:21.367
Devour your own daughter.
Just do it already!

44:21.450 --> 44:22.826
[menacing music playing]

44:22.910 --> 44:24.495
[roaring]

44:30.209 --> 44:32.252
- Do it!
- [roaring ferociously]

44:32.336 --> 44:33.420
Mother, don't!

44:41.470 --> 44:43.180
[gentle music playing]

44:51.480 --> 44:52.940
[Chae-ok breathing shakily]

45:00.114 --> 45:01.657
[creature snorts curiously]

45:10.124 --> 45:10.958
Mother?

45:11.542 --> 45:13.377
[sobbing gently]

45:13.919 --> 45:15.379
[creature growls softly]

45:19.550 --> 45:20.926
What happened to you?

45:23.220 --> 45:24.680
[growling softly]

45:26.265 --> 45:29.268
[sobbing] I'm sorry I wasn't here!

45:36.066 --> 45:37.359
I'm so sorry!

45:40.779 --> 45:42.781
[creature moans]

45:47.202 --> 45:48.620
[moans]

45:56.378 --> 45:57.379
[Chae-ok] Mommy!

45:58.756 --> 46:00.132
[giggling]

46:00.215 --> 46:02.134
[sentimental music playing]

46:39.546 --> 46:40.964
[music intensifies]

47:04.446 --> 47:05.405
Shoot it!

47:06.281 --> 47:07.115
Fire!

47:07.199 --> 47:08.200
[gasps]

47:09.076 --> 47:10.702
- [roaring]
- [Chae-ok grunts]

47:13.580 --> 47:15.082
[creature roaring]

47:15.916 --> 47:18.001
- [roaring]
- [heavy gunfire]

47:20.087 --> 47:21.839
[growling, hisses]

47:24.925 --> 47:26.885
[creature's tentacles creaking]

47:33.559 --> 47:35.185
[creature moans despondently]

47:36.478 --> 47:38.021
[groaning mournfully]

47:40.607 --> 47:42.568
[heavy gunfire continues]

47:44.027 --> 47:45.821
[Chae-ok breathing shakily]

47:47.114 --> 47:48.323
Oh, Mother.

47:50.951 --> 47:52.119
[groaning softly]

47:53.120 --> 47:54.329
Release the gas!

47:54.413 --> 47:55.873
Release the gas!

47:56.957 --> 47:58.250
[rifles cocking]

48:04.506 --> 48:06.133
[creature growling]

48:08.969 --> 48:10.012
[Chae-ok groans]

48:10.971 --> 48:11.805
[gasps]

48:17.102 --> 48:18.896
- Shoot her!
- Open fire!

48:20.397 --> 48:22.149
[solemn music playing]

48:24.526 --> 48:26.820
[creature growling]

48:28.822 --> 48:31.575
[Chae-ok grunts, groaning]

48:34.119 --> 48:35.704
[gunfire continues]

48:37.331 --> 48:39.082
[creature roaring]

48:58.268 --> 49:00.187
[gunfire, roaring fades]

49:04.483 --> 49:05.817
[solemn music continues]

49:08.236 --> 49:09.529
[inaudible]

49:13.992 --> 49:15.619
[solemn music continues]

49:35.138 --> 49:36.723
[ethereal vocalizing]

50:08.046 --> 50:09.756
[gunfire continues]

50:13.969 --> 50:15.637
Hold your fire. Hold your fire!

50:22.894 --> 50:23.770
Where's the girl?

50:23.854 --> 50:25.480
Where did she go?

50:25.564 --> 50:26.815
Find her now!

50:29.985 --> 50:31.611
[Chae-ok screaming] No!

50:31.695 --> 50:32.904
Let go of me!

50:32.988 --> 50:34.906
- Let go!
- Come back! What are you doing?

50:34.990 --> 50:36.366
- Mother!
- Where are you going?

50:36.450 --> 50:38.618
[Chae-ok screaming]

50:38.702 --> 50:40.704
- [panting]
- Hey! Get ahold of yourself!

50:40.787 --> 50:43.540
Where do you think you're going?
Do you wanna be killed?

50:43.623 --> 50:44.791
[sobbing]

50:45.667 --> 50:47.377
[sobbing breathlessly]

50:49.087 --> 50:50.881
That's my mother.

50:54.009 --> 50:54.885
Wait, what?

50:56.178 --> 50:57.012
What?!

50:57.095 --> 50:59.139
[sobbing]

51:01.141 --> 51:05.062
[breathlessly] They turned her
into that… that creature.

51:05.145 --> 51:07.355
Those bastards did that to her.

51:09.941 --> 51:10.942
Help me.

51:12.444 --> 51:14.029
Oh, what do I do?

51:15.322 --> 51:16.573
Please help me.

51:16.656 --> 51:17.908
[sobbing]

51:19.910 --> 51:21.119
Please help me.

51:31.797 --> 51:33.799
[heaving sobs]

51:39.429 --> 51:41.348
[wailing sobs]

51:54.027 --> 51:55.487
[unsettling music playing]

52:06.540 --> 52:07.874
[Kato] How peculiar.

52:08.667 --> 52:12.921
I wonder why this time the nitrogen
was ineffective in subduing the creature.

52:15.340 --> 52:17.300
Maybe its maternal instincts…

52:19.636 --> 52:21.263
somehow overpowered the Najin.

52:22.139 --> 52:23.890
What should we do about the woman, sir?

52:28.270 --> 52:29.729
Find her and kill her.

52:31.690 --> 52:32.691
[Haneda] Yes, sir!

52:39.156 --> 52:41.324
Listen up, everyone. Follow me.

52:42.033 --> 52:43.785
The hunt begins now, yeah?

52:43.869 --> 52:45.120
[all] Yes, sir!

52:45.203 --> 52:46.580
[dramatic music playing]

52:55.589 --> 52:57.757
[Haneda] This is an emergency!
Quick, let's go!

52:57.841 --> 53:00.886
Don't lose her.
Find her! Search everywhere!

53:05.182 --> 53:06.892
[music fades]

53:32.083 --> 53:35.212
Here, try one.
It might help you feel a little better.

53:40.759 --> 53:42.177
[tender music playing]

53:55.774 --> 53:56.942
[grunts softly]

54:06.451 --> 54:08.787
I know better
than to ask you if you're okay.

54:10.580 --> 54:13.708
Because I already know that… you aren't.

54:18.255 --> 54:19.256
Even still…

54:21.633 --> 54:23.218
I hope you'll feel better.

54:28.098 --> 54:30.934
I still remember
the last words my mother said to me.

54:32.227 --> 54:34.688
She told me to… stay alive.

54:37.315 --> 54:39.818
She told me to survive, no matter what.

54:42.988 --> 54:45.115
At the time, I was only nine years old.

54:47.784 --> 54:49.995
I was way too young to comprehend it all,

54:51.788 --> 54:54.958
what it would mean to…
survive without her.

55:03.758 --> 55:05.969
For now, let's just get out of here alive.

55:08.179 --> 55:11.057
Then together, we can figure out
the best way to help your mother.

55:14.811 --> 55:16.146
[inhales shakily]

55:17.522 --> 55:19.733
[exhales sharply] Can I have another one?

55:33.997 --> 55:35.373
[candy wrapper rustling]

55:35.957 --> 55:37.500
[breathes shakily]

55:46.843 --> 55:47.761
[inhales shakily]

56:18.875 --> 56:19.918
[soldier] Yes, sir!

56:30.303 --> 56:31.346
[breathes shakily]

56:33.681 --> 56:35.266
[shuddering breaths]

56:38.228 --> 56:39.479
[truck engine idling]

56:40.313 --> 56:41.606
[engine stops]

56:46.694 --> 56:48.446
[engine struggles, starts]

56:53.785 --> 56:55.286
[suspenseful music playing]

57:19.018 --> 57:20.186
What are you doing?

57:22.897 --> 57:24.399
You can't park your vehicle here, sir.

57:24.482 --> 57:27.402
I'm, uh, just waiting
for Commissioner Ishikawa, you see.

57:27.485 --> 57:29.446
He asked me to wait here. Also, look here.

57:31.030 --> 57:31.990
[glass clinking]

57:33.158 --> 57:34.742
I have some wine for us to share.

57:34.826 --> 57:35.785
No alcohol allowed.

57:35.869 --> 57:38.705
Hey, now. Are you always
this rigid with your guests?

57:39.789 --> 57:42.876
Let's have one drink, huh?
Just you and me. How about it?

57:43.626 --> 57:45.628
The weather's a little bitter,
more than usual.

57:45.712 --> 57:48.715
So if you wanna stay warm, we should,
uh, maybe drink some of this wine.

57:48.798 --> 57:51.801
- It's not allowed.
- [scoffs] Hold on.

57:51.885 --> 57:53.386
[mischievous music playing]

57:56.264 --> 57:57.807
Not even champagne?

57:58.475 --> 57:59.309
Champagne?

57:59.392 --> 58:00.560
Oh, thank goodness.

58:02.937 --> 58:04.939
All right, let's go. Let's go.

58:05.023 --> 58:06.274
Just, uh, follow me, sir.

58:15.742 --> 58:18.077
- Report on level three.
- Level three was empty, sir.

58:18.161 --> 58:20.371
- And level two?
- It was empty, sir.

58:20.455 --> 58:23.458
We think… we think she may have
already escaped the hospital, sir.

58:26.085 --> 58:28.963
I want you and your men
to search the entire military ward.

58:29.047 --> 58:31.174
The underground laboratory,
the admissions ward,

58:31.257 --> 58:32.342
and the first-floor offices.

58:32.425 --> 58:33.384
Yes, sir!

58:33.927 --> 58:36.012
First Sergeant Haneda! [panting]

58:37.722 --> 58:38.973
You need to see this, sir.

58:42.352 --> 58:43.353
Please help us.

58:44.270 --> 58:46.272
This is outta control!

58:47.023 --> 58:48.608
[suspenseful music playing]

59:01.829 --> 59:04.582
- [soldier 1] You searched over there?
- [soldier 2] I'll search now, sir.

59:05.083 --> 59:07.168
[soldier 1] Start from the end.
Search thoroughly.

59:07.252 --> 59:10.380
[soldier 2] There was a recent outbreak
of tuberculosis in that ward.

59:10.463 --> 59:12.632
[soldier 1] I don't care!
Those are your orders!

59:13.132 --> 59:14.259
[soldier 2] Yes, sir!

59:14.342 --> 59:16.052
[footsteps approaching]

59:24.310 --> 59:25.937
[tense music playing]

59:42.370 --> 59:43.580
[gasping]

59:46.291 --> 59:47.166
No, Father!

59:51.379 --> 59:53.256
- Chae-ok, it's you.
- [relieved sigh]

59:59.178 --> 01:00:00.513
I'm glad to see you.

01:00:12.900 --> 01:00:13.901
Dad…

01:00:14.736 --> 01:00:15.987
[breathing shakily]

01:00:16.070 --> 01:00:17.780
Are you all right, Chae-ok?

01:00:20.408 --> 01:00:22.035
[footsteps approaching]

01:00:29.459 --> 01:00:30.293
Myeong-ja?

01:00:35.757 --> 01:00:38.760
Master Jang, let me escape with you all.
I need to get out of here.

01:00:58.988 --> 01:01:00.490
[microphone feedback]

01:01:03.743 --> 01:01:05.453
[adventurous music playing]

01:01:07.246 --> 01:01:10.249
All right, it's time, everyone.
We have ten minutes.

01:01:10.333 --> 01:01:11.918
[clock ticking]

01:01:16.631 --> 01:01:19.133
When the truck pulls up,
we have ten minutes to escape.

01:01:20.468 --> 01:01:21.386
[Mr. Gu chuckles]

01:01:27.350 --> 01:01:28.851
[ticking]

01:01:31.145 --> 01:01:32.480
[clock ticking]

01:01:35.608 --> 01:01:39.195
We all have to move quickly.
I don't want anyone to get left behind.

01:01:41.447 --> 01:01:44.075
What if we don't get
everyone into the truck on time?

01:01:44.701 --> 01:01:45.785
What happens then?

01:01:46.953 --> 01:01:50.456
The truck will still leave.
We have to save who we can, I'm sorry.

01:01:59.799 --> 01:02:02.468
Completely seal off the military ward
and block every entrance.

01:02:02.552 --> 01:02:03.970
No one gets out of here!

01:02:04.470 --> 01:02:05.304
Go!

01:02:05.388 --> 01:02:06.389
Yes, sir!

01:02:09.392 --> 01:02:11.352
All right, are we all ready to do this?

01:02:13.396 --> 01:02:14.731
[music builds]

01:02:24.824 --> 01:02:25.783
It's time.

01:02:26.743 --> 01:02:27.994
Let's get out of here.

01:02:32.457 --> 01:02:33.374
[music fades]

